  {
   "text": "Can AI pick a random number?",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.22
  },
  {
   "text": "We asked two models for a number from one to ten, thirty times each.",
   "start": 2.78,
   "end": 6.08
  },
  {
   "text": "A fair pick lands on each number about three times.",
   "start": 6.64,
   "end": 8.84
  },
  {
   "text": "Google's Flash-Lite said seven, thirty times.",
   "start": 9.68,
   "end": 12.06
  },
  {
   "text": "OpenAI's GPT-OSS said seven, thirty times.",
   "start": 12.06,
   "end": 15.86
  },
  {
   "text": "A random pick would vary.",
   "start": 16.5,
   "end": 17.5
  },
  {
   "text": "This did not.",
   "start": 18.16,
   "end": 18.6
  },
  {
   "text": "From one to a hundred, Google's Flash-Lite chose forty-two most often, twenty-six times.",
   "start": 19.38,
   "end": 24.26
  },
  {
   "text": "OpenAI's GPT-OSS chose fifty-seven most often, twelve times.",
   "start": 24.26,
   "end": 28.96
  },
  {
   "text": "People reportedly do it too: the blue-seven effect.",
   "start": 28.96,
   "end": 32.52
  },
  {
   "text": "For a fair draw, use dice, or ask AI to write code.",
   "start": 33.2,
   "end": 36.42
  },
  {
   "text": "Never let it pick your giveaway winner.",
   "start": 37.12,
   "end": 38.44
  }
